1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:10,870
Assalam o Alaikum! Aaj NestPOS mein Product, Kitchen Item aur Recipe ka connection dekhein.

2
00:00:10,870 --> 00:00:21,241
Product customer ko becha jata hai. Kitchen Item kaccha saman hai. Recipe batati hai ke ek Product banane mein kitna saman lagta hai.

3
00:00:23,141 --> 00:00:34,648
Menu se Ingredients kholen. Yahan kitchen ka kaccha saman darj hota hai — chawal, chicken, oil aur sauce.

4
00:00:34,648 --> 00:00:46,155
Har item ka unit, rate, maujooda stock aur kam se kam stock limit dikhti hai. Stock limit se neeche jaye, to system khabardar karta hai.

5
00:00:48,055 --> 00:00:58,635
Naya Kitchen Item add karne ke liye Add Ingredient dabayein.

6
00:00:58,635 --> 00:01:09,214
Naam Tamatar, unit kg, rate nabbe rupay, stock bees kg aur kam se kam limit paanch rakhein. Save — kitchen ka saman record mein shamil ho gaya.

7
00:01:11,114 --> 00:01:22,817
Ab Product ko Kitchen Items ke saath jorne ke liye Recipes kholen. Beef Pulao ki recipe dekhein.

8
00:01:22,817 --> 00:01:34,520
Ek plate ke liye pao kilo chawal aur pachaas gram oil darj hai. Ek Product mein kai Kitchen Items, aur ek Kitchen Item kai Products mein use ho sakta hai.

9
00:01:36,420 --> 00:01:45,955
Ab sale ka asar dekhein. Sale screen se ek Beef Pulao chunen aur CASH payment karein.

10
00:01:45,955 --> 00:01:55,489
Cart mein add karne par stock foran kam nahi hota. Bill final hone ke baad recipe ke mutabiq Kitchen Stock khud minus hota hai.

11
00:01:57,389 --> 00:02:07,759
Yaad rakhein: Product customer ko becha jata hai. Kitchen Item banane mein kharch hota hai. Recipe dono ko milati hai.

12
00:02:07,759 --> 00:02:18,130
Recipe ek baar theek bana dein, to har final sale par stock ka hisaab khud chalta rahega. Shukriya!